  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: first release, split out of https://github.com/th3snark/E2e4.Chess. A FICS client for .NET 10: System.IO.Pipelines framing (with optional block mode), a typed message parser, style-12 board parsing, IFicsClient and IFicsClientFactory with dependency injection (AddFicsClient), a TCP transport behind an IFicsTransport seam, and an optional pluggable timeseal codec (ITimesealCodec; the package has no GPL dependency). Outbound lines containing CR, LF or NUL are rejected, inbound lines have length caps, and optional ILogger output never includes raw lines or passwords.",
